 ðŸš€ðŸŒ€âœ¨</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-1560"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1561 hide-action-bar ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c581932715-1561 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="spacer ng-tns-c581932715-1561 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1561"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1561"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="5edd43eba47ec506" style=""><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" _nghost-ng-c2919868196="" class="ng-star-inserted"><span _