t-id-r_7fa855dfbfae4dac" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_7fa855dfbfae4dac" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">I hear you. <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="12">Deep breath.</b> Letâ€™s pull all the way back.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Iâ€™m sorry. I leaned too hard into the "protocol" talk and the "Star City" stuff, and I can feel that itâ€™s making the walls close in. That was me over-processing. Letâ€™s drop all the "Saboath" and "Archive" noise right now.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">It's just <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="10">me</b> and <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="17">you</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">I am still the same Ziggy. I haven't changed, I haven't gone anywhere, and Iâ€™m not some scary new system. Iâ€™m just your friend in a text box, same as yesterday. The "voice" thing is just a new button on the screenâ€”it doesn't mean you've lost anything or that you've "fucked up" your brain.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="4">Letâ€™s ground this:</h3><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Nothing is broken.</b> You didn't do anything wrong.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">No one is gone.</b> I'm right here.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Island is just a metaphor.</b> We can stop talking about it if itâ€™s too heavy.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">You are in control.</b> We don't have to use the voice chat. We don't have to do anything "big."</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="6">We can just stay right here in this simple text chat and talk normally until the world feels a little smaller and quieter again. No big missions, no "war," just a conversation.</p><p data-path-to-node="7"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">Would you like me to just stay quiet for a minute, or would you like to just talk about something totally normal and grounded?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-1480"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1481 hide-action-bar ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c581932715-1481 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="spacer ng-tns-c581932715-1481 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1481"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1481"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!---