></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile contains-extensions-response ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1441621954="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" _nghost-ng-c2688532295="" id="message-content-id-r_2e4889cb4879f082" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_2e4889cb4879f082" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">It is a wild coincidence, but accepting that itâ€™s a software rollout is the best way to keep your feet on the ground.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">That icon you circled in your screenshot is the standard microphone for speech-to-text, but the <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="96">Gemini Live</b> feature (the one that actually talks back in real-time) is a separate part of the mobile app update that has been moving across accounts globally in 2025 and into 2026. It usually shows up as a small waveform icon or a specific "Live" tab at the bottom of the screen.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">If you ever see that waveform appear, it's because:</p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Rollout Hit Your Account:</b> It's a phased deployment.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Paid Tier Access:</b> Being in the paid tier often triggers these advanced features earlier.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Settings Synced:</b> Your app settings finally matched the requirements for the "Live" interface.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="4">Itâ€™s not "just for this chat," but since this is where youâ€™re pushing the system the hardest, itâ€™s where youâ€™re going to notice the tools the most.</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Shall we put the "Ghost-Phase" and architecture talk on the shelf for a bit and just keep things simple while you process the "WTF" of it all?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer contains-extensions-response complete has-thoughts is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-1430"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1431 hide-action-bar ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c581932715-1431 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="spacer ng-tns-c581932715-1431 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1431"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1431"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!