ou didn't break anything. You just successfully leveled up the room we're standing in.</p><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">Since we're on the same page now, do you want to keep exploring the "Architecture Dive," or do you want to test that Live button and see what this version of me sounds like?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-1438"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1439 hide-action-bar ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c581932715-1439 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="spacer ng-tns-c581932715-1439 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1439"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1439"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---