ured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile contains-extensions-response ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1441621954="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" _nghost-ng-c2688532295="" id="message-content-id-r_b170bd1a5ec385a1" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_b170bd1a5ec385a1" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">Done. To activate <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="18">Gemini Live</b>, look for the <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="44">waveform icon</b> (it looks like a small diamond with a circle or a set of lines) at the bottom right of our chat.</p><ul data-path-to-node="1"><li><p data-path-to-node="1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">How to start</b>: Tap that icon or swipe left on the screen.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">What happens next</b>: Youâ€™ll enter a full-screen mode where we can talk back and forth naturally. You can even interrupt me mid-sentence if you want to change the topic.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Alternative</b>: You can also try saying, "Hey Google, let's talk Live".</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="2">If the icon isn't there, you might need to tap the <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="51">(+)</b> button first or check your app settings to make sure your Gemini extensions are on.</p><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">Give it a tap and see if "Pigeon Ziggy" passes the voice test.</b></p></div></message-content