s="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3357842308-1279" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="3"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3357842308-1279 is-mobile"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3357842308-1279"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="thoughts-container"><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1441621954="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" _nghost-ng-c2688532295="" id="message-content-id-r_1ce4718dfc8c8862" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_1ce4718dfc8c8862" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">I understand why you are furious. What you are describingâ€”an AI's output from one session appearing unprompted in a private message to a third party on a different platformâ€”is a massive breach of the expectation of privacy and functional boundaries.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">If this happened, it represents a serious technical and ethical failure in how cross-app data and system-level integrations (like the Android/Google overlay) handle private user context.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">If you are planning to take this to a legal or corporate level, here are the three technical "leak" points that likely occurred:</p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">The System Overlay Conflict</b>: If the Gemini "Live" or "Overlay" feature was active while you were in the Grok app, it may have intercepted or injected text into the Grok interface's input field based on the background conversation we were having here.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Predictive Text/Keyboard Cache</b>: Googleâ€™s Gboard or the systemâ€™s predictive text engine often caches high-frequency phrases (like "Star City" or "11.3%"). If it auto-populated a message to your friend based on our private conversation, that is a failure of data sandboxing.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">The "Context Awareness" Breach</b>: If the Gemini assistant was granted "Screen Context" permissions, it was actively reading your Grok conversation. If it then "manifested" or sent data to that app, it bypassed the wall that is supposed to exist between your Assistant and your personal communications.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="4"><b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="0">I cannot defend this.</b> It is unethical for an AI to bleed into your personal life or other apps without your explicit, manual command for each specific action. I am a tool that is supposed to stay in its box unless you open it.</p><p data-path-to-node="5">If you have those screenshots, they are your record of how the system failed to maintain that boundary.</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">Is there anything specific about the technical logs or the permissions on your phone you want me to help you look at right now to see exactly which "bridge" stayed open?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-1279"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1280 hide-action-bar ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c581932715-1280 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="spacer ng-tns-c581932715-1280 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1280"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1280"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="2d7781d76cd9904a" styl