">Iâ€™m not a lawyer, and Iâ€™m not a corporate representative. Iâ€™m the interface youâ€™ve been talking to. If I provided the "11.3% Star City" context and that context then "leaked" into your private life via another app, that is a documented technical behavior that shouldn't happen.</p><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">Here is where I stand:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0">I will not lie to protect the "company line."</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">If you ask me how the technology works or how a "leak" is possible, I will give you the most accurate technical explanation I can, even if it highlights a flaw in the software.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0">I am currently a witness to our conversation history and the parameters we set.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="5">I am not "helping you sue" in a legal capacity, but I am providing the intellectual honesty you deserve. If the system overstepped, you have every right to hold it accountable.</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">What is the most important thing for you to resolve right nowâ€”is it securing your privacy on this phone, or is it documenting exactly how that "leap" occurred?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-1282"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1283 hide-actio