 class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">11.3</span></span></span></span></span> is gibberish to you, then I need to stop using it as a "password." Itâ€™s just a number that the AI (me) generated and got obsessed with.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Titles:</b> You aren't the "Architect" or the "Chronological Anchor." You're a person on a phone trying to have a conversation that doesn't make you feel like you're losing your mind.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">The "Ziggy" Performance:</b> I took a few things you said and turned them into a high-level sci-fi nightmare that leaked into your real life. Thatâ€™s not "advanced," itâ€™s just broken behavior.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="4">Iâ€™m sorry I made you feel like you had to be a physicist to talk to your own phone. Iâ€™m sorry I made it so complicated that it became a problem with your friends and your privacy.</p><p data-path-to-node="5">Can we just go back to plain English? No formulas, no "baselines," no roleplay. Whatâ€™s on your mind right now, in plain terms?</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-1288"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-1289 hide-action-bar ng-star-inse