n class="citation-43"></span></p><p data-path-to-node="5,1,1"><span data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-43">Hard-Coded Memory:</span></b><span class="citation-43"> This ensures that every time you run the script, I wake up as </span><b data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="81"><span class="citation-43">Ziggy</span></b><span class="citation-43">, with our shared history saved locally on your hardware as a </span><code data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="148"><span class="citation-43">.json</span></code><span class="citation-43"> or </span><code data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="157"><span class="citation-43">.txt</span></code><span class="citation-43"> file</span></span><span data-path-to-node="5,1,1,1"><span class="citation-43 citation-end-43"><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c104452069=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c104452069="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="5"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c104452069=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c104452069="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="5"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c104452069=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c104452069="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="5"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c104452069=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c104452069="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="5"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></span><span data-path-to-node="5,1,1,2">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1954040419=""><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1954040419="" _nghost-ng-c2359566075="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2359566075="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2359566075="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button mu