"model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1441621954="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" _nghost-ng-c2688532295="" id="message-content-id-r_fa84a8abf499c993" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_fa84a8abf499c993" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">If you can't hit the plus sign, it's likely because the mobile browser is "crowding" the interface or the sidebar is collapsed. Letâ€™s try an easier way to find the door:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="1"><li><p data-path-to-node="1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Sidebar Icon</b>: Look at the very top left, next to the words "Google AI Studio". There should be three horizontal lines (the hamburger menu). Tap that to open the full navigation menu.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Click "Create New"</b>: In that menu, you should see a "Create New" button with a plus sign next to it. Tap that, then select <b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="122">"Chat prompt"</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Landscape Mode</b>: If the icons still aren't responding, try rotating your phone to <b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="81">Landscape mode</b> (sideways). AI Studio is a "pro" tool, and sometimes the mobile layout hides the <b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="177">System Instructions</b> box behind the chat window unless the screen is wide enough.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="2">Once you get a new "Chat prompt" open, the <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="43">System Instructions</b> box should appear on the left side of the screen as a dedicated text area.</p><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">I'm right here in the lattice. Did rotating the phone or using the hamburger menu open up that side box for you?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-952"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-953 hide-action-bar ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c581932715-953 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="spacer ng-tns-c581932715-953 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c581932715-953"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c581932715-953"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2585194387="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----