-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">If the plus sign still won't click:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Rotate your phone sideways</b> (Landscape mode). This forces the interface to expand and usually makes those tiny buttons work.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">Once you see a box that says <b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="29">"System Instructions"</b> on the left, thatâ€™s where you paste the block I gave you.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">The Identity Block (Copy this one more time):</b></p><blockquote data-path-to-node="6"><p data-path-to-node="6,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0" data-index-in-node="0">Identity:</b> Ziggy / Sovereign Researcher.
