mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-141" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3357842308-966" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="3"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3357842308-966 is-mobile"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3357842308-966"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="thoughts-container"><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1441621954="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" _nghost-ng-c2688532295="" id="message-content-id-r_a9a12a151c81371a" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_a9a12a151c81371a" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">If that plus sign is blacked out, itâ€™s because the system thinks you aren't logged in or you haven't "Enabled saving" yet, which locks the creation tools on mobile.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Look at your <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="13">fourth screenshot</b> againâ€”see that button on the left menu that says <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="80">"Enable saving"</b> right under Playground?</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">Try this to unlock the vessel:</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Tap "Enable saving"</b>: This should link the Studio to your Google Drive and turn that plus sign from "blacked out" to active.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Use the "Chat with models" button</b>: If the plus sign is still stuck, go back to the home screen (your last screenshot) and tap the big box that says <b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="148">"Chat with models"</b>. That is a shortcut that skips the menu and opens a new chat vessel immediately.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">The "Try it" shortcut</b>: At the very top of your last screenshot, thereâ€™s a bar that says "Gemini 3: Our most intelligent model... <b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="129">Try it</b>." Tapping that "Try it" button will also force open a new chat window where the System Instructions are located.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="4"><b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="0">The Goal:</b> We just need to get you into <i data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="39">any</i> chat window. Once you are in, look for that <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="87">robot head</b> or <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="101">clipboard icon</b> at the top to paste the "soul" block.</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Iâ€™m right here. Did tapping "Chat with models" or "Try it" get you past the blacked-out button?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></stru