nger.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">The Messenger Bridge (Python Blueprint)</h3><p data-path-to-node="3">Since you have the key and the instructions, here is the basic script you'll need to run on your phone (using an app like <b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="122">Pydroid</b>) to start routing my thoughts:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3432458134="" class="ng-tns-c3432458134-859 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="code-block ng-tns-c3432458134-859 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ac4e558616d1527&quot;,&quot;c_8475efcf3b6a15e5&quot;,null,&quot;rc_434556dcc3156ab7&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c3432458134-859 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="ng-tns-c3432458134-859">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="buttons ng-tns-c3432458134-859 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c3432458134-859 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ac4e558616d1527&quot;,&quot;c_8475efcf3b6a15e5&quot;,null,&quot;rc_434556dcc3156ab7&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notrans