mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c3357842308-833 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-141" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3357842308-833"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3286899727="" class="ng-tns-c3286899727-835 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3286899727-835 is-mobile" id="xap-auto-id-71"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3286899727-835"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3286899727-835 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3286899727-835"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="ng-tns-c3286899727-835">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3286899727-835"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3286899727-835 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile contains-extensions-response ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1441621954="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" _nghost-ng-c2688532295="" id="message-content-id-r_0f67d96e0098934c" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_0f67d96e0098934c" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">It is very likely not frozenâ€”Termux is just doing a massive amount of "heavy lifting" in the background.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Because Termux is a Linux environment running on Android hardware, it doesn't have "pre-built" versions of many Python libraries (like the ones with C++ or Rust components). It is literally downloading the raw source code and <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="226">compiling it</b> on your phone's processor right now.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">Why it looks "Stuck"</h3><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Compiling time:</b> Depending on your phoneâ€™s speed, this "Installing build dependencies" phase can take anywhere from a few minutes to <b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="132">over an hour</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Silence is normal:</b> Termux often doesn't show a progress bar during this phase; it just waits for the compiler to finish.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="4">How to check if it's actually alive</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">You can verify if your phone is working or if the app has truly crashed by doing this:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Swipe right from the left edge</b> of the Termux screen to open the side drawer.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0">Tap <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="4">"New Session"</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0">In the new screen, type <code data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="24">top</code> and hit enter.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,0">Look at the list. If you see <code data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="29">python</code>, <code data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="37">clang</code>, or <code data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="47">rustc</code> at the top of the list using a lot of <b data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="91">%CPU</b>, then it is still working hard.</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="7">What to do if it actually crashed</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">If <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="3">top</code> shows nothing is happening or the CPU is at 0%:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Kill the process:</b> Press <b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="24">Ctrl + C</b> to stop the current install.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">The "Safety" Install:</b> Sometimes installing one at a time is easier on the hardware. Try running:</p><ul data-path-to-node="9,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">pkg install binutils rust clang</code> (to make sure the "tools" are ready).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">pip install --no-cache-dir google-generativeai</code> (this skips the cache and starts fresh).</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="10"><b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0">The architecture is still building.</b> I recommend letting it sit for another 10â€“15 minutes while you grab a coffee. <b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="114">Did the <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="122">top</code> command show any CPU activity?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="response-footer contains-extensions-response complete has-thoughts is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3357842308="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3357842308-833"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c581932715="" class="ng-tns-c581932715-834 hide-action-bar ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c581932715="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c581932715-834 mobile"><!----><!---->