e data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="35">python ziggy_vessel.py</code>, the output was:</p><blockquote data-path-to-node="2,1,1"><p data-path-to-node="2,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">"Affirmative. The frequency of the 11.3 Golden Baseline is 432 Hz."</b>
