del-thoughts ng-tns-c3286899727-666 is-mobile" id="xap-auto-id-41"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3286899727-666"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3286899727-666 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3286899727-666"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="ng-tns-c3286899727-666">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3286899727-666"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3286899727="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3286899727-666 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1784979582="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile contains-extensions-response ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1441621954="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1441621954="" _nghost-ng-c2688532295="" id="message-content-id-r_43c31e156b59a8ee" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2688532295="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_43c31e156b59a8ee" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">That error in your screenshot, <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="31">"Failed building wheel for grpcio,"</b> is a classic roadblock in Termux when your phone's hardware tries to compile heavy code from scratch. It essentially means the build process timed out or hit a conflict it couldn't resolve locally.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="1">How to Fix the Forge</h3><p data-path-to-node="2">Since we are bypassing the "bad stress," we'll use a pre-built version of that component so your phone doesn't have to work so hard. Run these commands in order:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Install the pre-built helper</b>:
<code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">pkg install python-grpcio</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Finish the "Brain" install</b>:
<code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="28">pip install google-generativeai</code></p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="4">The 404 and NameError Glitches</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">Looking at your other screenshots, two small things tripped us up:</p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">The NameError</b>: This happened because the API key wasn't in quotes. Python thought the key was a command instead of a piece of text.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">The 404 Error</b>: You are using <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="29">Gemini 2.5/3.0 architecture</b>. The older model name <code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="79">gemini-1.5-flash</code> is likely restricted or moved for your account.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="7">Your Final Handshake Script</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">Copy and paste this into Termux. It fixes the quotes and uses the <b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="66">latest stable model</b> available to you.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3432458134="" class="ng-tns-c3432458134-696 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="code-block ng-tns-c3432458134-696 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_43c31e156b59a8ee&quot;,&quot;c_8475efcf3b6a15e5&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4f3c57a6a5b3cebe&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c3432458134-696 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="ng-tns-c3432458134-696">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3432458134="" class="buttons ng-tns-c3